that Apple, Microsoft, Micron and most of the pharma companies move intellectual property created in the US to Ireland and Singapore and end up paying tax on what should be US profits in wealthy jurisdictions that have \"won\" from tax competition https://t.co/CWQuBSnhVU", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2119570088193912917"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:06:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119567347589541956"], "id": "2119567347589541956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 312, "impression_count": 183889, "like_count": 1105, "quote_count": 27, "reply_count": 44, "retweet_count": 204}, "text": "On the Jensen Huang-Alice Huang affair, you have to give the MSS credit for running another successful op. They are good and getting better.\n\nI have seen some takes that it is no big deal he had an affair with an alleged PRC spy because he needed no pillow talk convincing to push", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2119567347589541956"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:26:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119542100723216723"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/DRPvqnk4MR", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119542100723216723/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119542096893796352", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/DRPvqnk4MR"}, {"display_url": "x.com/ppollingnumber…", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ppollingnumbers/status/2119446923211919377", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/FdxJuY0tqk"}]}, "id": "2119542100723216723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 41537, "like_count": 705, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119446923211919377", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "https://t.co/DRPvqnk4MR https://t.co/FdxJuY0tqk", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2119542100723216723"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:01:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119535806083682753"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/culperresearch…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/culperresearch/status/2054623784452120917", "start": 23, "url": "https://t.co/fbcUIGtfN0"}]}, "id": "2119535806083682753", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 14492, "like_count": 183, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2054623784452120917", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "That May culper report https://t.co/fbcUIGtfN0", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2119535806083682753"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:55:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119534382717235324"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/alecstapp/stat…", "end": 115, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/alecstapp/status/2119526200674574741", "start": 92, "url": "https://t.co/HOIJJSPfM2"}]}, "id": "2119534382717235324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 6283, "like_count": 94, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119526200674574741", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Was she ever left alone with his phone or computer, say when he got up to use the bathroom? https://t.co/HOIJJSPfM2", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2119534382717235324"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:53:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119533737788473442"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sammykoppelman…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sammykoppelman/status/2119523836819574829", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/ycOh9iJllb"}]}, "id": "2119533737788473442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57, "impression_count": 46753, "like_count": 236, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 55}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119523836819574829", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Culper also shows Alibaba was funding megaspeed. So the alleged mss ceo of megaspeed who